[Name] LibCanberra
[Summary] Sound event library (libcanberra)
[Description] libcanberra plays event sounds via GStreamer/pulseaudio/null backends. Mutter 48+ optionally uses it for the sound_player feature. Build AFTER GLib 2.84 and BEFORE Mutter. Track: ~/.claude/projects/-home-nohearth-Projects-BuildLiveCD/memory/pantheon-stack-port.md
